<title>FINLAND: FORECAST - AKTIA SEES FINNISH '97 GDP RISING 4 PCT.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - AKTIA SEES FINNISH '97 GDP RISING 4 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aktia Bank has upgraded its</p>
<p>forecast for Finnish 1997 gross domestic product growth to 4.0</p>
<p>percent from 3.5 percent, the bank's investment research</p>
<p>department said in a statement received on Friday.</p>
<p>Aktia cut its forecast for the rise in Finnish 1997</p>
<p>inflation to 1.5 percent from 2.0 percent, and lowered its 1997</p>
<p>jobless rate forecast to 16.0 percent from 16.5 percent.</p>
<p>Key figures in Aktia's new forecast for 1997:</p>
<p> GDP		+4.0</p>
<p> Exports	  +6.0</p>
<p> Imports	  +5.0</p>
<p> Cons/priv	+4.0</p>
<p> Investment     +5.0</p>
<p> C/A (bln mk)    +20</p>
<p> CPI		+1.5</p>
<p> Jobless	  16.0</p>
<p>    --Helsinki Newsroom   +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
